  "id": "a4780392-6b99-5261-bba9-c29063d31ed0",
  "slug": "yummy-candied-yams",
  "name": "Yummy Candied Yams",
  "recipe_type": "dessert",
  "brief_description": "These candied yams are sweet potatoes are cooked on the stove with butter and sugar until thick and syrupy. Top with a dash of cinnamon if you like!",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "In a large pot over medium heat, place potatoes in water. Top with butter and sugar, cover and bring to a boil. Reduce heat to low and simmer, without stirring, until mixture is thick and syrupy, 40 minutes. Mixture will thicken slightly as it cools. Remove from heat and serve warm."
    }
  ],
